WEBVTT

00:15:28.536 --> 00:15:30.503
Da ste postigli svoj san

00:15:30.503 --> 00:15:32.115
devetogodišnjaka,

00:15:32.115 --> 00:15:33.754
koji je bio nemoguć

00:15:33.754 --> 00:15:36.644
i strašan,

00:15:36.644 --> 00:15:38.344
užasan.

00:15:38.344 --> 00:15:41.068
I kada to sprovedete u praksi,

00:15:41.068 --> 00:15:44.301
naučite da se reprogramirate,

00:15:44.301 --> 00:15:46.429
da promjenite svoj primarni strah.

00:15:46.429 --> 00:15:49.328
Tako da vam to nezaboravno iskustvo
dozvoli da

00:15:49.328 --> 00:15:53.268
vi postante inspiracija,

00:15:53.268 --> 00:15:54.611
za druge ljude

00:15:54.611 --> 00:15:57.737
koji su mislili da je to nemoguće.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:05.347
I za kraj su me pitali,
da sviram ovu gitaru.